---
import { books } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="books section" id="libros">
  <div class="shell books-grid">
    <div class="books-copy" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span>Autor</p>

      <h2>Lecciones de negocio para quienes están al frente.</h2>

      <p>
        Una mirada directa y práctica a los desafíos de construir,
        atender y dar continuidad a una empresa.
      </p>

      <div
        class="book-options"
        aria-label="Selecciona un libro para obtener más información"
      >
        {books.map((book, index) => (
          <a
            class="book-option"
            href={book.href}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label={`Más información sobre ${book.title}`}
          >
            <span class="book-option-number">
              {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
            </span>

            <span class="book-option-content">
              <strong>{book.title}</strong>
              <small>{book.description}</small>
            </span>

            <span class="book-option-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="book-stage" data-reveal>
      {books.map((book) => (
        <a
          class:list={['book', `book-${book.position}`]}
          href={book.href}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label={`Más información sobre ${book.title}`}
        >
          <img
            src={book.image}
            alt={book.alt}
            width={book.width}
            height={book.height}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />

          <span class="book-hover-label" aria-hidden="true">
            Ver libro ↗
          </span>
        </a>
      ))}

      <span class="book-badge">
        Ideas para<br />hacer empresa
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shell books-extra" data-reveal>
    <p class="books-extra-eyebrow">Más recursos</p>
    <div class="books-extra-row">
      <p>
        ¿Buscas más herramientas para atender —y no perder— tu tienda? En&nbsp;
        <strong>"El que tenga tienda"</strong> encontrarás contenido,
        comunidad y recursos complementarios a los libros.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://elquetengatienda.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Visitar elquetengatienda.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .book-options {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .book-option {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(193, 145, 63, 0.06);
    transition:
      transform 0.25s,
      border-color 0.25s,
      background 0.25s,
      color 0.25s;
  }

  .book-option:hover,
  .book-option:focus-visible {
    transform: translateX(6px);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .book-option:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(47, 184, 166, 0.35);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .book-option-number {
    color: var(--brass-dark);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .book-option-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .book-option strong {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .book-option small {
    color: rgba(10, 15, 26, 0.58);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .book-option:hover .book-option-number,
  .book-option:focus-visible .book-option-number,
  .book-option:hover small,
  .book-option:focus-visible small {
    color: var(--brass-light);
  }

  .book-option-arrow {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .book-option:hover .book-option-arrow {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
  }

  .book-hover-label {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px;
    bottom: 8px;
    padding: 8px 13px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.25s,
      transform 0.25s;
  }

  .book:hover .book-hover-label,
  .book:focus-visible .book-hover-label {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .book:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--cyan);
    outline-offset: 6px;
  }

  .books-extra {
    margin-top: 64px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .books-extra-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--brass-dark);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .books-extra-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .books-extra-row p {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(7, 27, 43, 0.65);
  }

  .books-extra-row strong { color: var(--ink); }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .book-option {
      grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr auto;
      padding: 15px;
    }

    .book-option small {
      display: none;
    }
  }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .books-extra-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }

</style>